      "Explains DefaultAzureCredential setup for TableServiceClient and TableClient.",
      "Provides examples for creating, reading, updating, deleting, and upserting entities.",
      "Covers partition queries, selected properties, list operations, and parameterized filters.",
      "Demonstrates same-partition batch transactions and async TableClient usage.",
      "Summarizes Python data type mappings for Azure Table Storage."
